plan-audit.md:329:**Problem.** SLT-EML-15 (d2) publishes to the registry the reconciled expected-mail set for one SLT Daily Core renewal, explicitly asserting 'zero renewal_invoice - suppressed for automatic subs with auto-renew on' and states 'this is the reference the D3-D12 watch uses to classify daily renewal mail'. SLT-EML-02 (d4) and SLT-EML-05 (d6) then each write _auto_renew=off on that very subscription for one cycle, deliberately producing an 'Invoice for subscription #SUB_CORE' email plus a manually-paid renewal on D4 and D6. The watcher, reading EML-15's table, will classify both as UNMAPPED and file them as leaks - and will also see the charge leg leave the order in a non-standard state.
